    {
      "name": "fetch_a_request_that_never_produced_a_response_is_unavailable",
      "comment": "DNS failure, connection refused, TLS error, CORS, abort — all fail before there is any response. Unclassified, this reaches the engine as a raw error with no kind, which is what the taxonomy exists to remove.",
